  "sourceTitle": "Rattlesnake Salad",
  "sourceText": "Rattlesnake Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 8:50am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 medium rattlesnake, cut up\n2 bay leaves\n2 clvs garlic\nteaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon poultry seasoning\n2 tablespoons sherry\nstalk celery, finely diced\n4 boiled eggs, diced\nonion, finely diced\ncup chopped sweet pickles\n1 cup mayonnaise\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine first 5 ingredients and boil until tender. Chop meat finely and mix well with remaining ingredients. Serve on sandwiches or over quartered tomatoes and lettuce.",
